Question 1 – Purchase, Purchase Return & GST Challan
Your company purchases 75 Dell Latitude Laptops from ABC Computer Systems Pvt. Ltd., 
registered in Karnataka, at 18% GST.
 Price of each Laptop – ₹72,000
 Unit Code – Pieces
 HSN Code – 8471
 GST Rate – 18%
 Invoice Number – KAR/26-27/118
 Invoice Date – 10-Aug-2026
Create a Purchase Order and then use it for creating a Purchase Voucher implementing Bill 
Wise Reference Details.
Post purchase, 5 Laptops are found defective. Raise a Debit Note to return the defective 
Laptops and adjust the applicable GST.
Calculate the available Input Tax Credit, GST liability and amount payable through the 
Electronic Cash Ledger. Generate the GST PMT-06 Challan for the balance GST payable and
record the CPIN and CIN.
