Question 3 – Multiple GST Transactions & Challan
1. Create Ledgers: Create Maharashtra Office Systems under Sundry Creditors and BrightEdge 
Technologies Pvt. Ltd. under Sundry Debtors. Set respective states and enable Bill-wise Details. 
2. Create Stock Items: Create Office Monitor – HSN 8528 – GST 18%; create Lenovo ThinkPad 
Laptop – HSN 8471 – GST 18%. 
3. Local Purchase: Purchase Order → 20 Monitors @ ₹24,000 → Apply CGST 9% + SGST 9% → 
Save. 4. Purchase Voucher: Purchase (F9) → Select Purchase Order → Verify GST → Enter Bill-wise 
Reference → Save. 
5. Interstate Sale: Sales Order → 30 Laptops @ ₹90,000 → Select Gujarat customer → Apply IGST 
18% → Save. 
6. Sales Voucher: Sales (F8) → Select Sales Order → Verify GST → Enter Bill-wise Reference → 
Save. 
7. Debit Note: Debit Note → 3 Monitors @ ₹24,000 → Select supplier → Adjust CGST/SGST → 
Save. 
8. Credit Note: Credit Note → 5 Laptops @ ₹90,000 → Select customer → Adjust IGST → Save. 
9. GST Calculation: Display More Reports → Statutory Reports → GST → GST Tax Analysis → Check 
Output GST, ITC and ITC adjustments. 
10. ITC Set-off & Challan: Verify eligible ITC → Calculate balance cash liability → Open GST 
Payment/Challan → Enter amount → Generate Challan → Record challan deta
